					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13945788#post-4849672</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13945788/foundation-cool-achievement-badges#post-4849672</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 20 Dec 2020 21:22:47 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>PeppersGhost</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1553042</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Those designs are super slick. Great job!</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;I'll&nbsp;take&nbsp;a&nbsp;stab&nbsp;at&nbsp;some&nbsp;suggestions.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong>Nurturer</strong>: Provide feedback on at least 10 drafts and/or ideas that become successful articles.</p> <p><strong>Tastemaker:</strong> Be among the first 50 upvotes on an article rated +300 or higher.</p> <p><strong>Early Adopter:</strong> Have an article included in a GOI or character tag at the time the tag is first created.</p> <p><strong>Pollice Verso:</strong> Cast a vote on at least 500 articles.</p> <p><strong>Contender:</strong> Participate in at least 5 contests.</p> <p><strong>Manuscript Marathon:</strong> Submit a successful entry for all 3 themes in an annual Jam Contest.</p> <p><strong>Fan Club:</strong> Rank amongst another author's top 10 fans on scpper.</p> <p><strong>Senior Researcher:</strong> Be a member for at least 3 years.</p> <p><strong>Peer-Reviewed:</strong> Write a successful article with the essay tag.</p> <p><strong>Window Dresser:</strong> Create a site theme that's used on at least 5 articles.</p> <p><strong>Stand-Up Citizen:</strong> Write a successful joke article.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13945788#post-4849623</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13945788/foundation-cool-achievement-badges#post-4849623</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 20 Dec 2020 19:32:07 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>JakdragonX</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5588260</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Here are some of my ideas! (You may have already seen them):</p> <p><strong>Crossing Paths</strong> - write an article with over five crosslinks to other articles.</p> <p><strong>Student Participation Award</strong> - Fully attend two site-hosted Workshops or Seminars. Bonus points if you publish an article that uses the knowledge you got from them!</p> <p><strong>Tag, You're It!</strong> - Write an article containing atleast 7 tags (not including scp, tale, goi-format, or object classes such as safe, euclid, esoteric, etc.)</p> <p><strong>That Broke the Camels Back</strong> - Either post three articles that exceeds 50 comments or 1 article that exceeds 150 comments in the Discussion section</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
