						 <p>Here's some ideas:</p> <ul> <li><strong>Teambuilding Exercise:</strong> Write an article that features at least three Groups of Interest.</li> <li><strong>Jolly Cooperation:</strong> Write an article where the Foundation collaborates with at least two Groups of Interest.</li> <li><strong>&quot;Hans, Are We The Baddies?&quot;:</strong> Write an article where the Foundation is explicitly an antagonistic force.</li> <li><strong>Took You Long Enough!:</strong> Post an article that has been in development for at least six months.</li> <li><strong>Birdie:</strong> Write an article for Tag Golf.</li> <li><strong>Cold Post, Warm Reception:</strong> Write a coldpost, then get it to at least +25.</li> </ul> 
