						 <p>The design on these is lovely and the titles are very creative!</p> <p>However, I would request that the &quot;Mr. Worldwide&quot; title perhaps be changed to something that's not as gendered? I understand that it's a reference to Pitbull and all, buuuuuut still.</p> <p>Anyway, again, great work on these in general!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
