					<![CDATA[
						 <p>How about international stuff like:</p> <div style="background: #ededed center no-repeat; float: center; border: solid 2px #CEA0FF; padding: 1px 15px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p><strong>Guest appearance -</strong> Write five articles with one or more characters from another language Branch. (Maybe only for Foundation Staff and no Author Avatars?)</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Attack from outside! –</strong> Write five articles for one or more Groups of Interest from another language Branch.</p> <hr /> <p><strong>A visit from another world –</strong> Write five articles for one or more canons from another language Branch.</p> </div> <p>… and non INT stuff:</p> <div style="background: #ededed center no-repeat; float: center; border: solid 2px #CEA0FF; padding: 1px 15px; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.2);"> <p><strong>Hey, I know that one! –</strong> Write an article about a minor Groups of Interest or person who has received little attention for some time or has no tag now.</p> <hr /> <p><strong>Just a second. They did what?! –</strong> Write three articles about a situation where two groups or people who would otherwise never work together do just that. Bonus points the crazier it is. Minus points if they do it under a trick like brainwashing or unknowingly.</p> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
