				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13945788/foundation-cool-achievement-badges#post-4847449</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 18 Dec 2020 06:19:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Yossipossi</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2199269</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Do you plan on adding some of the ones on <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-achievement-badges">Roget's page</a>? Specifically:</p> <ul> <li>Friend Of The People — Take part in 5 writing collaborations. You must be a full co-author, not just a contributor.</li> <li>Thousandaire — Entered into any of the X000 contests (i.e. SCP-1000, SCP-2000, SCP-3000, etc.)</li> <li>Sharpshooter — As an author of at least 10 articles on the wiki, have an average net upvote rating for your body of work that is at least +100</li> </ul> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13945788#post-4847446</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13945788/foundation-cool-achievement-badges#post-4847446</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 18 Dec 2020 06:06:30 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>LiterallyMechanical</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2829014</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This looks fun! Off the top of my head, a few ideas for more badges:</p> <ul> <li>Tall Tales — Published ten tales on the wiki. Individual chapters count, if they are their own pages.</li> <li>Containment Specialist: Safe/Euclid/Keter/Thaumiel/Explained — Separate badges in each object class for posting ten SCPs at that level.</li> <li>Canonized — Authored or co-authored a new canon.</li> <li>Thank You For Your Cooperation — co-authored five (or 10?) pages with at least five (or 10?) different people.</li> </ul> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
